  "details": "- fix CVE-2026-61915: double-free in the CalDAV VPATCH BYPARAM selector,\n  reachable by an authenticated calendar user patching a resource with two or\n  more properties of the matched kind\n- do not free VPATCH parameters already removed by reference: the parameter\n  stays owned by libical after icalproperty_remove_parameter_by_ref(), so the\n  following icalparameter_free() double-freed it and aborted the CalDAV worker\n  on any VPATCH carrying a PATCH-ACTION parameter\n- use strcmpsafe/strncmpsafe for PATCHACTION string matching:\n  icalparameter_get_xvalue() and icalproperty_get_value_as_string() may return\n  NULL on the same VPATCH path\n- disable the cassandane test runner by default: on i686 its noarch perl\n  dependencies are absent from the i686 mirror of centos8.4-Devel, and on x86_64\n  the prebuilt imaptest helper dies on SIGBUS (769 run, 0 failures, 64 errors,\n  all the same crash); the cunit suite continues to run on both architectures",
